s\\)</span> (strategy profile)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame4PureStrategyProfile}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame4PureStrategyProfile}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}pure\\text{-}strategy\\text{-}profile} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame4PureStrategyProfile}_S(N,\\vec S,s)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(\\vec S,N,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec S))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(s,N,\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec S))\\land\\forall i\\in N\\;(s(i)\\in\\vec S(i))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}pure\\text{-}strategy\\text{-}profile} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame4PureStrategyProfile}_S(N,\\vec S,s)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(\\vec S,N,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec S))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(s,N,\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec S))\\land\\forall i\\in N\\;(s(i)\\in\\vec S(i))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id